### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = anna-kowalska
@token = paste-clerk-jwt-here


### ==========================================
### PUBLIC BOOKING (no auth)
### ==========================================

### Public availability for a profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/p/{{username}}/availability
Accept: application/json

### Booked slots for a date (so frontend hides taken times)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/p/{{username}}/booked-slots?date=2026-06-10
Accept: application/json

### Create a booking (records BOOK event)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/p/{{username}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Test Client",
  "clientEmail": "client@example.com",
  "clientMessage": "Looking forward to the meeting!",
  "date": "2026-06-10",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "10:30"
}


### ==========================================
### MY AVAILABILITY (Pro only)
### ==========================================

### Get my availability schedule
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Save availability (replaces all slots)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "dayOfWeek": 0, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 1, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 2, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 3, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 4, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": true },
  { "dayOfWeek": 5, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": false },
  { "dayOfWeek": 6, "startTime": "09:00", "endTime": "17:00", "isActive": false }
]


### ==========================================
### MY BOOKINGS
### ==========================================

### List bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirm a booking (replace UUID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel/decline a booking (replace UUID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### SUBSCRIPTION
### ==========================================

### Get subscription info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create Stripe checkout session (requires STRIPE_SECRET_KEY locally — returns 503 if missing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/create-checkout-session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
